WEBVTT

00:10.768 --> 00:12.561
Good morning, Patrick.
早上好，帕特里克。

00:15.423 --> 00:17.837
Hup! Good morning, SpongeBob!
哈！早上好，海绵宝宝！

00:17.837 --> 00:20.113
Wanna go for a bike ride
through jellyfish fields?
想去骑自行车
穿过水母区？

00:20.113 --> 00:22.285
You bet your square pants
I do!
你打赌你的方裤
我愿意！

00:23.802 --> 00:25.975
Oh, I love bike riding.
哦，我喜欢骑自行车。

00:31.871 --> 00:34.147
I forgot I don't have a bike.
我忘了我没有自行车。

00:34.147 --> 00:36.147
No problem.
I have a spare.
没问题。
我有一个备用的。

00:37.630 --> 00:40.182
Hmm. Uh-oh.
唔。呃哦。

00:40.182 --> 00:42.285
Hold on, it'll just
take me a minute to find it.
坚持住，只会
请花一分钟时间找到它。

00:42.285 --> 00:44.216
Hm!
嗯！

00:46.113 --> 00:48.458
Sorry, Patrick,
I just can't seem to...
对不起，帕特里克，
我只是似乎无法...

00:50.147 --> 00:51.147
Find it.
找到它。

00:53.527 --> 00:56.837
Check out this sweet ride!
看看这个甜蜜的旅程！

00:57.802 --> 00:59.182
Thanks Gare Bear.
谢谢盖尔熊。

01:00.596 --> 01:01.940
Eee!
哎呀！

01:06.596 --> 01:09.458
Come on, SpongeBob!
Follow me!
加油，海绵宝宝！
跟我来！

01:12.147 --> 01:16.561
Oh, yeah. I don't know how
to ride a bike.
哦，是的。我不知道怎么办
骑自行车。

01:19.216 --> 01:25.009
I guess I can't go bike riding
with you, SpongeBob!
我想我不能去骑自行车
和你一起，海绵宝宝！

01:25.009 --> 01:28.216
Now, don't you worry
your pretty, pink, pointy head.
现在，你不用担心
你漂亮的、粉红色的、尖尖的头。

01:28.216 --> 01:31.596
I can teach you how
to be an expert bicyclist.
我可以教你如何
成为一名自行车专家。

01:31.596 --> 01:33.975
Oh, nice!
哦，不错！

01:33.975 --> 01:38.320
I'm gonna be an icicle mist!
我要变成冰柱薄雾！

01:38.320 --> 01:41.251
Lesson one: How to properly
sit on a bike.
第一课：如何正确
坐在自行车上。

01:41.251 --> 01:42.733
Face forward,
面朝前，

01:42.733 --> 01:45.699
arms parallel but loose,
双臂平行但放松，

01:45.699 --> 01:48.147
both feet placed
firmly on the sand.
双脚放置
牢牢地固定在沙子上。

01:48.147 --> 01:50.113
Uh, okay, then.
呃，好吧，那么。

01:50.113 --> 01:51.527
Uh, here I go.
呃，我来了。

01:51.527 --> 01:52.802
Turn around.
回转。

01:52.802 --> 01:53.906
Other side.
对方。

01:53.906 --> 01:55.113
- Uh--
- Ahh!
- 呃--
- 啊！

01:55.113 --> 01:56.354
But not quite.
但也不完全是。

01:56.354 --> 01:57.699
Okay, uh, gettin' there.
好的，呃，到了。

01:57.699 --> 01:59.147
How's this?
这怎么样？

02:02.182 --> 02:05.871
Uh, maybe we need
a more hands-on approach.
呃，也许我们需要
更实际的方法。

02:05.871 --> 02:07.802
Handlebars grasped firmly,
牢牢握住车把，

02:07.802 --> 02:10.147
tushy planted,
feet stable,
郁郁葱葱的种植，
脚稳定，

02:10.147 --> 02:11.561
and ta-da!
还有哒哒！

02:11.561 --> 02:13.871
I did it!
我做到了！

02:14.699 --> 02:17.354
Don't worry, you just need
to get the hang of it.
别担心，你只需要
掌握它的窍门。

02:18.561 --> 02:20.423
Yeah, almost got it.
是的，差不多明白了。

02:21.527 --> 02:22.699
Ah!
啊!

02:23.596 --> 02:24.768
Nearly there.
快到了。

02:26.216 --> 02:27.251
Close.
关闭。

02:31.320 --> 02:32.285
You know, Patrick,
你知道，帕特里克，

02:32.285 --> 02:35.044
I think you have
gravity trouble.
我想你有
重力麻烦。

02:35.044 --> 02:37.320
I don't know what
you're talkin' about.
我不知道什么
你说的是。

02:37.320 --> 02:38.837
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

02:38.837 --> 02:40.389
Those should keep you upright.
这些应该让你保持直立。

02:44.113 --> 02:46.078
Maybe some training wheels.
也许一些辅助轮。

02:49.733 --> 02:51.802
That'll make you
a little more stable.
这会让你
更稳定一点。

02:51.802 --> 02:55.320
That's what
my psychiatrist says.
就是这样
我的精神科医生说。

02:56.354 --> 02:58.665
Hm. Uh!
嗯。呃！

02:58.665 --> 03:00.423
Yah.
嗯。

03:00.423 --> 03:02.009
Ooh, ah.
哦，啊。

03:02.009 --> 03:03.492
Yow! Uh!
哟！呃！

03:04.561 --> 03:05.596
Haa!
哈！

03:05.596 --> 03:07.389
Whoa!
哇！

03:07.389 --> 03:09.044
Ay!
- Ah! Ehh!
哎呀！
- 啊！呃！

03:09.044 --> 03:10.285
Oyy.
哎呀。

03:10.285 --> 03:14.078
Ohh!
哦！

03:14.078 --> 03:16.871
Hmm. Time to check
under the hood.
唔。检查时间
在引擎盖下。

03:20.009 --> 03:22.078
Whoa, just as I thought.
哇，和我想的一样。

03:22.078 --> 03:23.871
Your brain's a bit unbalanced.
你的脑子有点不平衡。

03:27.078 --> 03:28.630
Doy! Uhh!
多伊！呃！

03:28.630 --> 03:30.423
Ohh. Ohh!
哦。哦！

03:30.423 --> 03:32.113
Ah-whoo-hoo!
啊呼呼！

03:33.527 --> 03:34.906
Now give it a try.
现在尝试一下。

03:36.320 --> 03:37.906
Rah-hoo-hoo!
啊呼呼！

03:37.906 --> 03:40.078
I think someone's
ready to pedal!
我认为某人的
准备好踩踏板了！

03:40.078 --> 03:43.630
I think so, too!
我也这么认为！

03:43.630 --> 03:45.078
Who?
- That's it.
WHO？
- 就是这样。

03:45.078 --> 03:47.492
Now, pedal nice and easy.
现在，轻松轻松地踩踏板。

03:49.113 --> 03:50.733
And don't you let go!
还有你别放手！

03:50.733 --> 03:53.802
Don't worry, buddy. I won't
take my hands off this bike.
别担心，伙计。我不会
把我的手从这辆自行车上拿开。

03:53.802 --> 03:56.009
I promise.
我保证。

03:56.009 --> 03:58.630
I'm doing it!
我正在做！

03:58.630 --> 04:00.009
Hey!
嘿！

04:00.009 --> 04:01.423
Huh?
啊？

04:01.423 --> 04:02.768
I didn't let go!
我没有放手！

04:02.768 --> 04:05.182
Ohh!
哦！

04:09.423 --> 04:11.630
You need something
to help you focus.
你需要一些东西
帮助您集中注意力。

04:11.630 --> 04:13.768
Way ahead of ya.
远远领先于你。

04:13.768 --> 04:15.630
Mmm.
嗯。

04:15.630 --> 04:19.182
Ooh, hello.
哦，你好。

04:19.182 --> 04:20.837
Yeah, it's working, Patrick!
是的，它起作用了，帕特里克！

04:20.837 --> 04:22.354
You're doing great!
- Ohh!
你做得很好！
- 哦！

04:26.389 --> 04:27.458
Huh?
啊？

04:30.699 --> 04:32.285
For now, just observe me.
现在，就观察我吧。

04:32.285 --> 04:34.837
Take a closer look
and see how it's done.
仔细看看
看看它是如何完成的。

04:42.320 --> 04:43.768
Ahh!
啊！

04:46.147 --> 04:48.940
Watch my feet,
and do what I do.
注意我的脚，
做我做的事。

04:51.354 --> 04:52.906
Ooh.
哦。

04:58.354 --> 05:00.216
That's it.
Now you're getting it.
就是这样。
现在你明白了。

05:00.216 --> 05:02.837
Now pedal
just a little bit faster.
现在踏板
只是快一点点。

05:02.837 --> 05:03.837
Faster?
快点？

05:03.837 --> 05:05.423
Oh, ohh.
哦，哦。

05:07.389 --> 05:09.458
Oh, a little too fast there, Patrick.
哦，有点太快了，帕特里克。

05:09.458 --> 05:10.665
Just relax.
放松点。

05:10.665 --> 05:11.940
I'm relaxed!
我轻松了！

05:16.940 --> 05:18.871
I'm so happy
我太高兴了

05:18.871 --> 05:22.044
we have some time
to ourselves, Puffykins.
我们有一些时间
对我们自己来说，普菲金斯。

05:22.044 --> 05:24.320
Without any interruptions
from--
没有任何打扰
来自——

05:26.044 --> 05:27.389
Look out!
当心！

05:27.389 --> 05:28.837
Sponge!
海绵！

05:28.837 --> 05:29.940
Bob!
鲍勃！

05:33.078 --> 05:34.665
What in the name
名字里有什么

05:34.665 --> 05:37.699
of all that's salty
are you two dipsy doodles--
所有咸的东西
你们是两个迪普西涂鸦吗——

05:37.699 --> 05:38.802
- Squidward.
- What?
- 章鱼哥。
- 什么？

05:38.802 --> 05:40.423
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

05:40.423 --> 05:41.871
♪ La da dee
la da dum ♪
♪ 拉达迪
拉达杜姆 ♪

05:45.699 --> 05:46.940
Of course.
当然。

05:56.354 --> 05:59.251
Ahh!
啊！

05:59.251 --> 06:01.699
Hi, Mrs. Puff.
嗨，普芙女士。

06:01.699 --> 06:03.492
Hello, SpongeBob.
你好，海绵宝宝。

06:03.492 --> 06:05.561
You know, I'm having
a little trouble
你知道，我有
有点麻烦

06:05.561 --> 06:08.561
trying to teach Patrick
how to ride a bicycle.
试图教导帕特里克
如何骑自行车。

06:08.561 --> 06:11.699
Have you ever had trouble
teaching a student, Mrs. Puff?
你有遇到过麻烦吗
泡芙女士，教学生吗？

06:13.975 --> 06:16.561
Ehh.
呃。

06:16.561 --> 06:20.113
Some people are just unteachable.
有些人就是不可教。

06:33.492 --> 06:35.285
Unteachable?
不可教？

06:35.285 --> 06:38.182
Unteach!
That's it!
不教！
就是这样！

06:41.975 --> 06:43.975
Thanks, Mrs. Puff!
谢谢，泡芙女士！

06:46.561 --> 06:49.354
We're having our next date
at home.
我们即将迎来下一次约会
在家里。

06:51.665 --> 06:53.561
You know what
your problem is, Patrick?
你知道吗
你的问题是，帕特里克？

06:53.561 --> 06:56.596
Your brain is just too full
of unimportant knowledge.
你的大脑太满了
不重要的知识。

06:57.733 --> 07:01.906
Yeah, it is pretty
jam-packed.
是的，很漂亮
挤满了人。

07:01.906 --> 07:05.423
Or is it packed with jam?
或者里面塞满了果酱？

07:10.492 --> 07:13.216
We need to make some room
in your head for bike riding.
我们需要腾出一些空间
在你的脑海里骑自行车。

07:13.216 --> 07:15.733
Let's see. Do you remember
how to brush your teeth?
让我们来看看。你还记得吗
如何刷牙？

07:15.733 --> 07:17.078
Of course.
当然。

07:17.078 --> 07:20.009
I even know how
to comb my teeth.
我什至知道如何
梳理我的牙齿。

07:24.630 --> 07:26.423
Uh!
呃！

07:29.975 --> 07:31.527
Well, now you don't.
好吧，现在你不知道了。

07:31.527 --> 07:33.630
Whoo-hoo! Uh!
呼呼！呃！

07:33.630 --> 07:36.940
How to watch TV?
Nah, not important.
如何看电视？
不，不重要。

07:36.940 --> 07:38.423
Dah!
呸！

07:38.423 --> 07:41.285
Put on your pants?
Overrated.
穿上裤子吗？
被高估了。

07:41.285 --> 07:43.699
- Uh!
- Family? Ehh.
- 呃！
- 家庭？呃。

07:43.699 --> 07:45.389
Unnecessary.
不必要。

07:48.044 --> 07:50.216
Uhh--
呃——

07:50.216 --> 07:52.665
Patrick, what is your name?
帕特里克，你叫什么名字？

07:52.665 --> 07:55.940
Who is I?
我是谁？

07:55.940 --> 07:57.837
Ooh, I think someone's
finally ready
哦，我想有人
终于准备好了

07:57.837 --> 07:59.285
to ride a bicycle!
骑自行车！

08:26.458 --> 08:28.113
All right, Patrick,
you're ready.
好吧，帕特里克，
你准备好了。

08:28.113 --> 08:29.906
There's just one more thing
to remember--
还有一件事
记住——

08:29.906 --> 08:31.354
have fun.
玩得开心。

08:34.975 --> 08:39.320
I have no knowledge
of bike riding.
我没有知识
骑自行车的。

08:40.389 --> 08:43.665
Huh? Patrick, get off
that bike before it's too late!
啊？帕特里克，下车
那辆自行车在为时已晚之前！

08:43.665 --> 08:45.596
Don't worry, SpongeBob.
别担心，海绵宝宝。

08:45.596 --> 08:48.389
It's just Bread Man's Hill.
这只是面包人山。

08:48.389 --> 08:50.009
That's not Bread Man's Hill,
那不是面包人山，

08:50.009 --> 08:51.768
it's Dead Man's Hill!
这是死人岭！

08:51.768 --> 08:53.768
Wha--is that worse?
什——那更糟糕吗？

08:53.768 --> 08:55.389
It sounds worse.
听起来更糟。

08:56.940 --> 08:58.423
It is worse!
更糟糕的是！

08:58.423 --> 09:00.940
Ohh no!
哦不！

09:00.940 --> 09:02.354
Whoa!
哇！

09:02.354 --> 09:04.078
Yah!
啊！

09:04.078 --> 09:05.975
Huh. Whoa!
呵呵。哇！

09:07.009 --> 09:09.009
SpongeBob, I'm doing it!
海绵宝宝，我来了！

09:09.009 --> 09:12.596
I'm bicycling!
我骑自行车！

09:22.596 --> 09:24.147
Ahh!
啊！

09:37.596 --> 09:38.906
Uh!
呃！

09:40.975 --> 09:42.320
Uh!
呃！

09:43.768 --> 09:46.561
In honor of becoming
the greatest bicyclist
为了纪念成为
最伟大的自行车手

09:46.561 --> 09:49.354
who has ever lived,
I present you the key
谁曾活过，
我给你钥匙

09:49.354 --> 09:51.216
to Bikini Bottom.
- Ah.
到比基尼底部。
- 啊。

09:51.216 --> 09:53.320
Oh, and the lock!
哦，还有锁！

09:53.320 --> 09:56.802
Patrick! Patrick! Patrick!
帕特里克！帕特里克！帕特里克！

09:56.802 --> 09:58.665
Patrick! Patrick!
帕特里克！帕特里克！

09:58.665 --> 09:59.699
Patrick?
帕特里克？

09:59.699 --> 10:02.078
Oh, thank Neptune
you're okay.
哦，谢谢海王星
你没事吧。

10:02.078 --> 10:04.113
Of course I'm okay.
我当然没问题。

10:04.113 --> 10:07.527
I'm an expert bicyclist now.
我现在是一名自行车专家了。

10:07.527 --> 10:10.665
Patrick, you crashed all
the way down Dead Man's Hill.
帕特里克，你让一切都崩溃了
下死人山的路。

10:10.665 --> 10:11.871
Hmm.
唔。

10:19.320 --> 10:21.320
You've been in a coma
for six weeks.
你一直处于昏迷状态
六个星期。

10:21.320 --> 10:22.768
Whoa!
哇！

10:22.768 --> 10:24.837
A new personal best.
新的个人最好成绩。

10:24.837 --> 10:27.906
Sorry I couldn't teach you
how to ride a bike, Patrick.
抱歉没能教你
如何骑自行车，帕特里克。

10:27.906 --> 10:30.113
Who needs a dumb bike?
谁需要一辆笨自行车？

10:30.113 --> 10:32.802
I am a bike!
我是自行车！

10:32.802 --> 10:34.251
Hop on, buddy!
跳吧，伙计！

10:34.251 --> 10:36.216
Let's roll!
让我们滚吧！

10:38.802 --> 10:40.492
Whee!
哎哟！

10:40.492 --> 10:41.354
Ohh!
哦！

10:41.354 --> 10:43.320
Ahh!
啊！

10:43.320 --> 10:45.009
- Ahh--
- Look out!
- 啊啊--
- 小心！

10:50.733 --> 10:52.837
both: Whoo!
两人：哇！

10:55.768 --> 10:58.354
Huh. I don't know how
to ride a Patrick.
呵呵。我不知道怎么办
骑帕特里克。

呵呵。我不知道怎么办
骑帕特里克。